I want to be a person who can sing and dance, and I want to be able to do various things such as acting.

233
00:17:29,164 --> 00:17:33,024
I want to become a person who can be active in any field.

234
00:17:42,544 --> 00:17:46,074
Thank you for watching.

235
00:17:46,074 --> 00:17:51,314
I wasn't really satisfied with the first one.

236
00:17:51,314 --> 00:17:56,514
I wasn't satisfied with my first performance, but I think I grew more in the second performance than in the first.

237
00:17:56,514 --> 00:17:58,634
I didn't win any awards.

238
00:17:58,634 --> 00:18:02,174
I didn't win any prizes, but it made me want to try again.

239
00:18:02,174 --> 00:18:06,074
I still can't get the rhythm of a detailed song.

240
00:18:06,074 --> 00:18:08,734
I want to be able to listen to it and get it.

241
00:18:09,616 --> 00:18:19,556
I will do my best in singing and dancing so that those who support me will be happy that they are supporting me.

242
00:18:19,556 --> 00:18:21,696
Thank you for your support!

243
00:18:39,616 --> 00:18:52,250
Thank you for watching!

244
00:18:52,250 --> 00:18:57,630
Mif and I are both members of Juice Juice from the Halo Pro trainees.

245
00:18:57,630 --> 00:19:03,430
I heard that the atmosphere of each generation of trainees is different.

246
00:19:03,430 --> 00:19:08,890
When I was a trainee, the atmosphere was like survival in a good way.

247
00:19:08,890 --> 00:19:14,350
There was a strong sense of rivalry among the trainees, and when we received the song assignments, we were the first to check them.

248
00:19:14,350 --> 00:19:17,830
Whenever I received a song assignment, I was the first one to check it and see where my song assignment was.

249
00:19:17,830 --> 00:19:18,170
It was amazing.

250
00:19:18,192 --> 00:19:27,952
What was it like when you were a trainee?

251
00:19:27,952 --> 00:19:37,572
When I first joined the company, I was really tense.

252
00:19:37,572 --> 00:19:46,132
I would get on the bullet train every day and when I got to the station I would start to get nervous.

253
00:19:46,144 --> 00:19:51,744
But at the end of the day, I was in the dressing room with Ayano Murakoshi of Rosy Chronicle, and we were playing YouTubers.

254
00:19:51,744 --> 00:19:56,644
We played “YouTube” in the dressing room.

255
00:19:56,644 --> 00:20:01,484
I still have that video, and I still have those memories.

256
00:20:01,484 --> 00:20:10,064
But the episodes from the second part of the show, when I was a trainee at the Hallo Pro, gave me the impression that they were really good friends.

257
00:20:10,064 --> 00:20:13,404
Please look forward to the next episode of Halo Pro Trainees Corner!

