260
00:20:16,504 --> 00:20:18,504
With Ria Matsunaga of Juice Juice Riai Matsunaga of Juice Juice and

261
00:20:18,504 --> 00:20:21,024
and Miho Kawashima of Juice Juice.

262
00:20:21,024 --> 00:20:26,984
This is our first MC for Halostei, so we'd like to dig a little deeper into Miho.

263
00:20:26,984 --> 00:20:31,724
We've asked some of the members and managers about Miho Kawashima's personality.

264
00:20:31,724 --> 00:20:33,164
I'd like to introduce some of them to you.

265
00:20:33,164 --> 00:20:36,344
Here are some episodes from the manager.

266
00:20:36,344 --> 00:20:38,324
Unexpected side of Miho Kawashima

267
00:20:38,784 --> 00:20:47,804
She may look quiet at a glance, but she is a talker and she and Matsunaga were singing and talking all the way to the shoot.

268
00:20:47,804 --> 00:20:50,684
She really is a talker!

269
00:20:50,684 --> 00:20:53,864
What do you think? What do you think of this unexpected side?

270
00:20:53,864 --> 00:20:57,944
Huh? But I don't have that image of her.

271
00:20:57,944 --> 00:20:59,544
The quiet side?

272
00:20:59,544 --> 00:21:06,584
I don't get the impression that she's shy and talkative.

273
00:21:06,584 --> 00:21:08,804
What? Yeah, I guess.

274
00:21:08,816 --> 00:21:15,536
I think I talk a lot when I'm in a good mood.

275
00:21:15,536 --> 00:21:19,416
I'm surprised that you didn't realize how talkative you are.

276
00:21:19,416 --> 00:21:26,416
In the JuiceJuice dressing room, there's always the sound of MIF laughing or talking.

277
00:21:26,416 --> 00:21:29,996
And I'm sure all the other members are too.

278
00:21:29,996 --> 00:21:35,736
I think the first thing that comes to mind is that MIF is a chatterbox.

279
00:21:35,744 --> 00:21:43,424
It's an aspect that is no longer surprising from the members' point of view, but at the beginning, she was really shy and catty.

280
00:21:43,424 --> 00:21:54,384
I was very shy and cat-like at first, so when we talk alone, we talk about many things, but I wonder what kind of things we talk about.

281
00:21:54,384 --> 00:22:03,924
When I'm with the members and we talk alone, we talk about the most trivial things, like how we're always joking around and how we're always talking about trivial things.

282
00:22:03,936 --> 00:22:09,436
We talk about nothing at all, but when we're alone, we talk about the future.

283
00:22:09,436 --> 00:22:16,056
But when we're alone, we talk about the future in a very serious way, and when we stay over together, we talk seriously until the morning.

284
00:22:16,056 --> 00:22:23,936
When we stay together, we talk seriously about work and imagine the future together.

285
00:22:23,936 --> 00:22:31,416
We also write about our future together.

286
00:22:31,416 --> 00:22:32,800
I'll start with my impression of Mif.

287
00:22:32,800 --> 00:22:38,360
I have the impression that Mif is very particular about what she does.

288
00:22:38,360 --> 00:22:44,100
When we go to a sushi restaurant, she eats hamachi all the time.

289
00:22:44,100 --> 00:22:48,360
She orders about 10 plates of hamachi and eats hamachi all the time.

290
00:22:48,848 --> 00:22:51,848
I think he's very particular.

291
00:22:51,848 --> 00:22:53,608
He is very particular.

292
00:22:53,608 --> 00:22:54,888
I'm aware of it.

293
00:22:54,888 --> 00:22:56,088
I'm aware of it.

294
00:22:56,088 --> 00:22:58,608
But eating the same thing all the time...

295
00:22:58,608 --> 00:23:00,008
It's really funny.

296
00:23:02,008 --> 00:23:03,308
It's funny.

297
00:23:03,308 --> 00:23:04,048
It's funny.It's funny.

298
00:23:04,048 --> 00:23:06,448
And there's something else that he's very particular about.

299
00:23:06,448 --> 00:23:07,708
Other than sushi.

300
00:23:07,708 --> 00:23:09,348
But for a long time

301
00:23:09,348 --> 00:23:12,248
He's been doing that dance for a long time.

302
00:23:12,248 --> 00:23:13,808
And...

303
00:23:13,808 --> 00:23:17,348
The position of your hands, the position of your feet...

304
00:23:17,360 --> 00:23:18,860
The angles...

305
00:23:18,860 --> 00:23:25,060
I think it's partly because my mother told me so much at the time.

306
00:23:25,060 --> 00:23:28,520
I've always been too particular about various people.

307
00:23:28,520 --> 00:23:31,960
I've been told I'm too particular in both good and bad ways.

308
00:23:31,960 --> 00:23:33,820
I think you're absolutely right.

309
00:23:33,820 --> 00:23:34,760
That's true.

310
00:23:34,760 --> 00:23:35,920
Haloste.

311
00:23:36,592 --> 00:23:41,312
I'm going to tell you an episode that impressed me.

312
00:23:41,312 --> 00:23:45,792
When Mifu was a guest at my birthday event.

313
00:23:45,792 --> 00:23:50,192
She was on a very tight schedule and seemed very anxious.

314
00:23:50,192 --> 00:23:56,472
But she practiced hard before the show and gave a wonderful performance.

315
00:23:56,472 --> 00:24:01,792
I was really impressed by his hard work.

316
00:24:01,792 --> 00:24:03,712
How was it?

317
00:24:03,744 --> 00:24:10,944
Well, it was the first day of the tour, so it was like a rehearsal tour.

318
00:24:10,944 --> 00:24:19,644
So I was really preoccupied, and I felt that I would rather attend other people's birthday events than my own birthday event.

319
00:24:19,644 --> 00:24:27,744
I felt more responsible to attend other people's birthday events than my own, so I wondered if I could handle it.

320
00:24:27,744 --> 00:24:32,784
That's why I've been wondering if I'm going to be okay.

321
00:24:32,784 --> 00:24:37,284
So as I was practicing at night, I was wondering if I could handle it.

322
00:24:37,284 --> 00:24:40,604
I called Mr. Matsunaga at night, right?

323
00:24:40,604 --> 00:24:41,544
While I was crying.

324
00:24:41,544 --> 00:24:43,004
Suddenly...

325
00:24:43,004 --> 00:24:46,004
“I don't know if I can do it.

326
00:24:46,004 --> 00:24:49,384
He called me in tears, saying he didn't know if he could do it.

327
00:24:49,384 --> 00:24:54,484
But I told him to go to bed for now and that we would work together tomorrow.

328
00:24:54,484 --> 00:24:58,284
It was a really great performance.

329
00:24:58,284 --> 00:24:59,444
You were so cool!

330
00:24:59,444 --> 00:25:00,024
Thank you so much!

331
00:25:00,024 --> 00:25:01,504
It was great!

332
00:25:01,504 --> 00:25:02,384
I was so anxious.

333
00:25:02,672 --> 00:25:08,812
I tried really hard not to let my anxiety out on stage.

334
00:25:08,812 --> 00:25:14,952
Now let me say hello again to you, the viewers of this show! Now, please say hello to all of you who are watching this show!

335
00:25:14,960 --> 00:25:20,620
I'm sure there are many more concerts to come, including JuiceJuice's fall tour.

336
00:25:20,620 --> 00:25:26,200
I'm sure there are many more concerts to come, but I'm going to enjoy each and every one of you at every concert with vigor.

337
00:25:26,200 --> 00:25:33,400
I hope I can express myself in such a way that you will think of JuiceJuice as something you've never seen before.

338
00:25:33,400 --> 00:25:34,160
I will do my best!

